        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk6-phrases-r5-03-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Acknowledge a fair point",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "This response concedes that the other person has a relevant point, sometimes revising an earlier position. The adverb does not mean physically reversing or falling.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他说今天太晚了，我想了想说，那倒也是。",
                "pinyin": "tā shuō jīntiān tài wǎn le ， wǒ xiǎng le xiǎng shuō ， nà dào yě shì 。",
                "meaning": "He says it is too late today. After thinking, I say that he has a point.",
                "audio": "ecefb91983abf366c7f6da467086728de610b973d0570cd66a43039c5df866ea"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
